@startuml Ideas Pages Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Ideas pages — sections and media

actor "Reader / Admin" as Client
participant IdeasPageController as Controller
participant "IdeasPage operation service" as Service
database "MySQL\nIdeas pages + media rows" as Repository
participant RouteService as Route
participant MediaItemProcessor as Media
participant "AWS S3" as S3

alt Read
  Client -> Controller : authenticated list or public detail
  Controller -> Service : query or id
  Service -> Repository : load page with sections
  Service -> Media : batch-load section media
  Service --> Client : page summary or full DTO
else Admin create or update
  Client -> Controller : multipart POST/PATCH
  Controller -> Service : page + complete section payload
  Service -> Repository : transaction: page and section diff
  Service -> Route : create/upsert private teacher-area route
  Service -> Media : persist the section-media diff
  Media -> S3 : upload/replace/delete changed files
  Service --> Client : IdeasPageResponseDto
else Admin delete
  Service -> Media : remove all section media rows
  Media -> S3 : delete owned objects
  Service -> Route : remove route
  Service -> Repository : remove sections and page
  Service --> Client : 204
end

note over Repository, S3
  Removed sections are cleaned with their media; failed uploads are compensated.
end note
@enduml
